<title>USA: Farr Co sets 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>Farr Co sets 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>EL SEGUND0, Calif. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Farr Co on Tuesday said its board of directors has authorized a three-for-two common stock split in the form of a 50 percent stock dividend, payable March 28, to shareholders of record March 7.</p>
<p>Farr currently has 3,813,686 shares of common stock outstanding. Persons entitled to a fractional share will receive cash in lieu of such fractional share.</p>
<p>&quot;The primary purpose...is to increase the number of shares outstanding in order to assist in improving the marketability of Farr Company's stock,&quot; Jack Meany, chief executive officer, said in a statement.</p>
